### {{ sec_num }}.1 Borehole Environment, Bad-Hole Flagging & Conditioning Criteria

* **Logging Environment & Mud System:** Tool profile `{{ qaqc_params.tool_type|default('WL') }}`, drilling fluid `{{ qaqc_params.mud_type|default('WBM') }}` (`{{ "%.1f"|format(qaqc_params.mud_weight_ppg|default(9.0)) }} ppg`), {% if qaqc_params.offshore %}offshore ($WD = {{ "%.0f"|format(qaqc_params.water_depth_m|default(0.0)) }}\text{ m}$, seabed anchor ${{ "%.1f"|format(qaqc_params.top_temp_c|default(4.0)) }}^\circ\text{C}$){% else %}onshore (surface anchor ${{ "%.1f"|format(qaqc_params.top_temp_c|default(15.0)) }}^\circ\text{C}$){% endif %}, geothermal gradient ${{ "%.1f"|format(qaqc_params.gradient_c_per_km|default(30.0)) }}^\circ\text{C/km}$, mud-program hole sections loaded: `{{ qaqc_params.hole_section_count|default(0) }}`.
* **Bad-Hole Flagging Criteria (`BADHOLE`):** Caliper washout $> {{ qaqc_params.caliper_limit }}$ in (inches) above bit size (`{{ qaqc_params.bitsize_in }} in` fallback), density pad-standoff correction $\Delta\rho > {{ qaqc_params.drho_limit }}$ g/cc, or rugose bulk density $\rho_b < {{ qaqc_params.rhob_min }}$ g/cc.
* **Borehole Conditioning Curves Evaluated:** {{ qaqc_params.badhole_criteria_used if qaqc_params.badhole_criteria_used else 'CALI, DRHO, RHOB multi-curve evaluation' }}.
* **Bad-Hole Mitigation Mode:** `{{ qaqc_params.badhole_treatment }}` (automatic fallback in rugose washouts to prevent optimistic density-porosity spikes).
* **Light-Hydrocarbon Invasion Correction:** Gaymard-Poupon neutron-density response correction applied where $\rho_{hc} = {{ qaqc_params.rho_hc }}$ g/cc and $HI_{hc} = {{ qaqc_params.hi_hc }}$.
{% if not is_single_well %}
* **Normalization Method:** {{ qaqc_params.norm_method }} across target reservoir zones.
{% endif %}

